      "Chinese simplified and traditional share the single documented zh language entry.",
      "Google lists Hebrew as iw; the application stores canonical he and accepts iw.",
      "CLDR maps legacy tl to fil; the product uses Google’s Filipino (Tagalog) choice.",
      "The mni alias selects the documented mni-Mtei output choice; explicit other Manipuri scripts are not aliases."
    ],
